data: {"id": "b67c6bb0fa0d4529-thinking-parallel_evidence-3586", "run_id": "b67c6bb0fa0d4529", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 1. 实体身份与生命周期确认\n\n| 属性 | 值 |\n|------|----|\n| Pod 名称 | `workload-79d9f8fd88-48j8r` |\n| Namespace | `aiops-case-10` |\n| UID | `f0496f24-4504-47ae-8b6d-685bd1536991` |\n| Node | `node2` |\n| Container | `app` |\n| Image | `xnet.registry.io:8443/observability/python:3-alpine` |\n| 创建时间 | `2026-09-14T02:27:40Z` |\n| 当前 Pod Phase | `Running`（但容器未 Ready） |\n| Container State | `Waiting: CrashLoopBackOff` |\n| 重启次数 | **7 次** |\n\n**身份确认完毕**：后续所有证据均绑定该 UID，无复用/生命周期冲突。\n\n---\n\n## 2. 各候选原因的事实判断\n\n### 候选 A：Exit Code 1", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 5, "ts_ms": 1789353774645, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

